    ilxtr:curatorNote "Dr. Caroline Cobine cited \"The spinal levels are from Gray’s Anatomy 40th edition, page 1293\". The statement was corrected by Dr. Caroline Cobine and it became: \"via lesser splanchnic nerve OR first OR second lumbar splanchnic nerves\". But we can say simply Lumbar splanchnic nerves because the term refers to L1 and L2 only. So we avoid creating extra terms." ;
