    ilxtr:curatorNote "Dr. Caroline Cobine corrected the statement and listed all the vias and left the following comment: \"The renal plexus is a subdivision of the intermesenteric plexus (formed by the contribution of the L1 and L2 splanchnic nerves). I ordered these from distal to proximal (organ to originating ganglion), not sure if this is the correct way to do this.\" Curator, Dr. Ilias Ziogas corrected the order of the vias from proximal to distal." ;
