    rdfs:label "neuron type sdcol c" ;
    skos:prefLabel "T13-L5 DRG to rexed laminae I or II or V or VII or X of T13-L5 or to following layers of descending colon: serosa via lumbar colonic nerve; myenteric plexus via lumbar colonic nerve via serosa via Longitudinal muscle layer; to Lamina propria mucosae via lumbar colonic nerve via Serosa via Longitudinal muscle layer via Myenteric nerve plexus via Circular muscle layer via submucosal nerve plexus; to Submucosal nerve plexus via lumbar colonic nerve via Serosa via Longitudinal muscle layer via Myenteric nerve plexus via Circular muscle layer" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ilxtr:NeuronEBM,
        ilxtr:NeuronSdcol,
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty ilxtr:hasCircuitRolePhenotype ;
            owl:someValuesFrom ilxtr:ProjectionPhenotype ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty ilxtr:hasCircuitRolePhenotype ;
            owl:someValuesFrom ilxtr:SensoryPhenotype ] ;
    ilxcr:hasComposerURI <https://composer.scicrunch.io/statement/182> ;
    ilxtr:curatorNote """12/10/2025 [ST]: removed ilx population identifier and Gary Mawe from provenance. added Gary Mawe as Expert Consultant. Removed region(layer) pair and promoted the layer to be the region, because it was  redundant
10/2025: This population has co-located axons and axon terminals. this is because the axon traverses through layers, with some layers also having terminations. To be revisited when we have time for this modeling question.""" ;
