    ilxtr:alertNote "Spatial extent: The review paper by Berthoud covers both liver and stomach and does not share reference for the spinal origin T7-T13. On the contrary, Magni et al they explicitly traced afferents of the liver and report T7-T12. Data source note: The reference that spinal sensory neurons travel via splanchnic nerves come from Anatomy, Back, Splanchnic Nerve https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK549856/. Information on the splanchnic nerve comes from ISBN13:978-1608312948." ;
