    ilxtr:curatorNote "Original name is \"Submandibular ganglion to oral mucosa via short unnamed nerve bundles\".  UBERON has a preferred lable of \"mouth mucosa\" also there is some ambiguity as to whether it is an exact syononym with \"oral mucosa\".  It is not clear.  So we are going to assume it is synonymous and use the preferred term and also code unnamed nerve bundles as post-ganglionic parasympathetic fiber as per populations 10 and 11." ;
